{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "d4895b95-c76d-8ab5-885d-e51544baa315",
  "created_at": "2026-02-23T10:45:10-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Maria Costa",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T10:40:20-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T10:40:25-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, good morning. My name is Maria Costa. I'm calling about trash pickup, and I have a couple of questions. Hold on, I have the paper here from the landlord. [pause] Okay."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T10:40:38-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, go ahead. What's going on?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T10:40:41-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So I have an old washing machine in the back that the previous tenant left. I want to know how I get it hauled away. Can it go out with the regular trash?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T10:40:55-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Big appliances usually don't go out with the regular weekly trash. Is it a washer, you said? Do you know if it's working or not?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T10:41:06-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It doesn't work. It's been sitting there. Let me see, the paper says, um, bulky items. [pause] Here. It says bulky items require a special pickup. Is that the same thing?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T10:41:19-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, that's the same idea. Bulky items like washers, couches, mattresses get a scheduled special pickup rather than the regular truck. Where's it located, what's the address?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T10:41:31-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "143 Dixon Street. In the North End. It's in the side yard by the fence, not at the curb yet."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T10:41:40-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, 143 Dixon. Is that a single-family or a multi-unit?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T10:41:45-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's a two-family. I'm on the first floor, I rent. The landlord said I should call, so I'm calling."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T10:41:53-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's fine, you can request it. I'll need a name and a number for the request. I have Maria Costa. What's the best number?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T10:42:03-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0175. That's my cell."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T10:42:06-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, 401-555-0175. And I'll note it's a washing machine. One thing, if it's a washer, make sure the hoses are off and the door is secured or removed. Crews don't like loose doors."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T10:42:20-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, the hoses are already off. The door, I'll tape it. Is that all right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T10:42:27-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Taping is fine. Don't put it out until the day before your scheduled date, so it's not sitting there days."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T10:42:36-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. And when is the date? Do I get a call?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T10:42:41-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The office will call you back with the date. With the storm last weekend, the nor'easter Saturday into Sunday, crews have been catching up on regular routes, so it might be a little bit before they schedule the special ones."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T10:42:58-05:00",
      "duration": 20,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's fine. It's been there for months, a week or two won't matter. Oh, the storm, it was quiet here in the North End, nothing major. I drove up to Island Park in Portsmouth yesterday to look at the water, and it was quiet. Very quiet this time of year."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T10:43:18-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I bet. Not much going on out there in February. Okay, anything else on the washer?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T10:43:25-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, a second question. My recycling bin. The lid cracked, and one of the wheels is broken too. How do I request a replacement?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T10:43:35-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "We can do that too. Is it the blue recycling cart, or the trash cart?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T10:43:42-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Let me look at the paper. [pause] It says recycling. The blue one. It's the blue one."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T10:43:50-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Same address, 143 Dixon Street? I'll put in a request for a replacement cart. Broken lid and a broken wheel."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T10:43:59-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, same address. Do I need to put the old one out or keep it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T10:44:06-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Leave the old one at the curb where you normally keep it. They'll pick up the damaged one when they drop the new one off. Just don't take it back inside."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T10:44:19-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Leave it at the curb. And is there a charge for that?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T10:44:25-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "For a damaged cart, I'm not going to quote you anything, but the office will tell you when they call about the washer if there's anything to it. Usually damaged ones are just swapped."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T10:44:39-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "All right. So I'll get one call about both things?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T10:44:44-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Should be. I'm putting both on the same note, with your cell number. If you don't hear anything in a week and a half or so, call back and ask for me, Denise."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T10:44:58-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, Denise. Let me write that down. A week and a half. Thank you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T10:45:04-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Maria. Have a good day."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T10:45:08-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too. Bye."
    }
  ],
